msgid "Lock screen picture of the signed-in user"
msgstr "Prisijungusio naudotojo užrakinimo ekrano paveikslėlis"

#: ClassroomHost/AppearanceFeatureController.cs
msgid ""
"The picture is set for the user signed in on each selected computer, also on Windows Home, and appears the next time the computer is locked. Other users of the computer keep theirs.\n"
"\n"
"Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Paveikslėlis nustatomas kiekviename pasirinktame kompiuteryje prisijungusiam naudotojui, taip pat Windows Home, ir pasirodo, kai kompiuteris kitą kartą užrakinamas. Kiti kompiuterio naudotojai lieka su savaisiais.\n"
"\n"
"Tęsti?"

#: ClassroomHost/AppearanceFeatureController.cs
