#: ClassroomHost/MainWindow.Websites.cs
msgid "Works by rewriting the hosts file, so it blocks the domain everywhere on the computer, not just in one browser - a determined student can still get around it (a VPN, a different DNS server, or the site's raw IP address), so treat this as a deterrent, not a filter. \"Add to the existing block\" reads each computer's own current list before adding to it, so running this on a room with mixed existing blocks never wipes one out by accident - unlike \"Replace\", which does exactly that."
